  "transformation_notes": [
    "Hourly rows (resolution_minutes = 60) from RegulatingBalancePowerdata up to the first full hour of ImbalancePrice data (validation.cutover_utc, mFRR EAM go-live on 2025-03-04); 15-minute rows from ImbalancePrice afterwards (the three transitional quarter-hours before the cutover are dropped).",
    "Hourly era: imbalance_price_eur_mwh = ImbalancePriceEUR, balancing_power_price_up/down = BalancingPowerPriceUp/DownEUR, mfrr_up/down_activated_mwh = mFRRUp/DownActBal, imbalance_mwh.",
    "15-minute era: imbalance_price_eur_mwh, spot_price_eur_mwh, dominating_direction (+1 up, -1 down, 0 none), satisfied_demand_mw, afrr_up/down_mwh and afrr_vwa_up/down_eur_mwh (aFRR volume-weighted averages), mfrr_marginal_up/down_eur_mwh. Energinet: before 2025-03-19 the price equals the Pricing Module price; the dominating direction is set by balancing (mFRR) demand before 2026-03-04 and by satisfied demand afterwards."
  ],
